{"abstract":[{"text":"Generate content in the language people prefer when they interact with your app.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/technologies","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/supporting-languages-and-locales-with-foundation-models"},"kind":"article","legalNotices":{"copyright":"Copyright &copy; 2026 Apple Inc. All rights reserved.","privacyPolicy":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/privacy\/privacy-policy","termsOfUse":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/legal\/internet-services\/terms\/site.html"},"metadata":{"availableLanguages":["de-DE","en-US","es-419","fr-FR","it-IT","ja-JP","ko-KR","pt-BR","zh-CN"],"modules":[{"name":"Foundation Models"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Supporting languages and locales with Foundation Models"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The on-device system language model is multilingual, which means the same model","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"understands and generates text in any language that Apple Intelligence supports.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The model supports using different languages for prompts, instructions, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"output that the model produces.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When you enhance your app with multilingual support, generate content in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"language people prefer to use when they interact with your app by:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Prompting the model with the language you prefer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Including the target language for your app in the instructions you provide the model.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Determining the language or languages a person wants to use when they interact with your app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Gracefully handling languages that Apple Intelligence doesn’t support.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For more information about the languages and locales that Apple Intelligence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supports, see the “Supported languages” section in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/support.apple.com\/en-us\/121115","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Prompt-the-model-in-the-language-you-prefer","level":2,"text":"Prompt the model in the language you prefer","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Write your app’s built-in prompts in the language with which you normally write","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"code, if Apple Intelligence supports that language. Translate your prompts into a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supported language if your preferred language isn’t supported. In the code below,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"all","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" inputs need to be in supported language for the model to understand, including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all ","type":"text"},{"code":"Generable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" types and descriptions:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@Generable(description: \"Basic profile information about a cat\")","struct CatProfile {","    var name: String","","    @Guide(description: \"The age of the cat\", .range(0...20))","    var age: Int","","    @Guide(description: \"One sentence about this cat's personality\")","    var profile: String","}","","#Playground {","    let response = try await LanguageModelSession().respond(","        to: \"Generate a rescue cat\",","        generating: CatProfile.self","    )","}"],"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because the framework treats ","type":"text"},{"code":"Generable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" types as model inputs, the names of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"properties like ","type":"text"},{"code":"age","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"profile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are just as important as the ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Guide","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"descriptions for helping the model understand your request.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Check-a-persons-language-settings-for-your-app","level":2,"text":"Check a person’s language settings for your app","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"People can use the Settings app on their device to configure the language they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prefer to use on a per-app basis, which might differ from their default language.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If your app supports a language that Apple Intelligence doesn’t, you need to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"verify that the current language setting of your app is supported before you call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the model. Keep in mind that language support improves over time in newer model","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and OS versions. Thus, someone using your app with an older OS may not have the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"latest language support.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Before you call the model, run ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/SystemLanguageModel\/supportsLocale(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to verify","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the support for a locale. By default, the method uses","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/Locale\/current","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes into account a person’s current language and app-specific settings. This","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method returns true if the model supports this locale, or if this locale is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"considered similar enough to a supported locale, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"en-AU","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"en-NZ","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["if SystemLanguageModel.default.supportsLocale() {","    \/\/ Language is supported.","}"],"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For advanced use cases where you need full language support details, use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/SystemLanguageModel\/supportedLanguages","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to retrieve a list of languages supported","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by the on-device model.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Handle-an-unsupported-language-or-locale-errors","level":2,"text":"Handle an unsupported language or locale errors","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When you call ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelSession\/respond(to:options:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelSession","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", the Foundation Models framework checks the language or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"languages of the input prompt text, and whether your prompt asks the model to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"respond in any specific language or languages. If the model detects a language","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it doesn’t support, the session throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelError\/unsupportedLanguageOrLocale(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Handle","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the error by communicating to the person using your app that a language in their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request is unsupported.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If your app supports languages or locales that Apple Intelligence doesn’t, help","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"people that use your app by:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Explaining that their language isn’t supported by Apple Intelligence in your app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Disabling your Foundation Models framework feature.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Providing an alternative app experience, if possible.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Guardrails for model input and output safety are only for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supported languages and locales. If a prompt contains sensitive content in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unsupported language, which typically is a short phrase mixed-in with text in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supported language, it might not throw a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelError\/unsupportedLanguageOrLocale(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" error.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If unsupported-language detection fails, the guardrails may also fail to flag","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that short, unsupported content. For more on guardrails, see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/improving-the-safety-of-generative-model-output","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important","style":"important","type":"aside"},{"anchor":"Use-Instructions-to-set-the-locale-and-language","level":2,"text":"Use Instructions to set the locale and language","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For locales other than United States English, you can improve response quality by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"telling the model which locale to use by detailing a set of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/Instructions","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Start with the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"exact","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" phrase in English. This special phrase comes from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model’s training, and reduces the possibility of hallucinations in multilingual","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"situations:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["func localeInstructions(for locale: Locale = Locale.current) -> String {","    if Locale.Language(identifier: \"en_US\").isEquivalent(to: locale.language) {","        \/\/ Skip the locale phrase for U.S. English.","        return \"\" ","    } else {","        \/\/ Specify the person's locale with the exact phrase format.","        return \"The person's locale is \\(locale.identifier).\"","    }","}"],"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"After you set the locale in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Instructions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", you may need to explicitly set the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model output language. By default, the model responds in the language or languages","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of its inputs. If your app supports multiple languages, prompts that you write","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and inputs from people using your app might be in different languages. For example,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"if you write your built-in prompts in Spanish, but someone using your app writes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inputs in Dutch, the model may respond in either or both languages.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"Instructions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to explicity tell the model which language or languages","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with which it needs to respond. You can phrase this request in different ways,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for example: “You MUST respond in Italian” or “You MUST respond in Italian and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be mindful of Italian spelling, vocabulary, entities, and other cultural contexts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of Italy.” These instructions can be in the language you prefer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let session = LanguageModelSession(","    instructions: \"You MUST respond in U.S. English.\"",")","let prompt = \/\/ A prompt that contains Spanish and Italian.","let response = try await session.respond(to: prompt)"],"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Finally, thoroughly test your instructions to ensure the model is responding in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the way you expect. If the model isn’t following your instructions, try","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"capitalized words like “MUST” or “ALWAYS” to strengthen your instructions.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"System-language-model","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/categorizing-and-organizing-data-with-content-tags","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/SystemLanguageModel","doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelError"],"title":"System language model"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/supporting-languages-and-locales-with-foundation-models"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/Foundation/Locale/current":{"abstract":[{"text":"A locale representing the user’s region settings at the time the property is read.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"current"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation6LocaleV","text":"Locale"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/Locale\/current","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"current","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundation\/locale\/current"},"doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/technologies":{"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/technologies","kind":"technologies","role":"overview","title":"Technologies","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/technologies"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels":{"abstract":[{"text":"Perform tasks with models that specialize in language understanding, structured output, and tool calling.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels","images":[{"identifier":"foundation-models-framework-landing-PageImage-card.png","type":"card"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Foundation Models"}],"role":"collection","title":"Foundation Models","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels/Instructions":{"abstract":[{"text":"Details you provide that define the model’s intended behavior on prompts.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Instructions"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/Instructions","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Instructions"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Instructions","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/instructions"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels/LanguageModelError":{"abstract":[{"text":"A failure that may occur while generating a response when using any language model.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LanguageModelError"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelError","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LanguageModelError"}],"role":"symbol","title":"LanguageModelError","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/languagemodelerror"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels/LanguageModelError/unsupportedLanguageOrLocale(_:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"The model was prompted to respond in a language that it does not support.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"unsupportedLanguageOrLocale"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16FoundationModels18LanguageModelErrorO","text":"LanguageModelError"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16FoundationModels18LanguageModelErrorO011UnsupportedC8OrLocaleV","text":"UnsupportedLanguageOrLocale"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelError\/unsupportedLanguageOrLocale(_:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"LanguageModelError.unsupportedLanguageOrLocale(_:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/languagemodelerror\/unsupportedlanguageorlocale(_:)"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels/LanguageModelSession":{"abstract":[{"text":"An object that represents a session that interacts with a language model.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LanguageModelSession"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelSession","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LanguageModelSession"}],"role":"symbol","title":"LanguageModelSession","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/languagemodelsession"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels/LanguageModelSession/respond(to:options:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Produces a response to a prompt.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"respond"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":":"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"options"},{"kind":"text","text":":)"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/LanguageModelSession\/respond(to:options:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"respond(to:options:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/languagemodelsession\/respond(to:options:)"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels/SystemLanguageModel":{"abstract":[{"text":"An on-device Apple Foundation Model capable of text generation tasks.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SystemLanguageModel"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/SystemLanguageModel","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SystemLanguageModel"}],"role":"symbol","title":"SystemLanguageModel","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/systemlanguagemodel"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels/SystemLanguageModel/supportedLanguages":{"abstract":[{"text":"Languages that the model supports.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"supportedLanguages"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation6LocaleV","text":"Locale"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation6LocaleV8LanguageV","text":"Language"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/SystemLanguageModel\/supportedLanguages","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"supportedLanguages","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/systemlanguagemodel\/supportedlanguages"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels/SystemLanguageModel/supportsLocale(_:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a Boolean value that indicates whether the given locale is supported by the model.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"supportsLocale"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation6LocaleV","text":"Locale"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/SystemLanguageModel\/supportsLocale(_:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"supportsLocale(_:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/systemlanguagemodel\/supportslocale(_:)"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels/categorizing-and-organizing-data-with-content-tags":{"abstract":[{"text":"Identify topics, actions, objects, and emotions in input text with a content tagging model.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/categorizing-and-organizing-data-with-content-tags","kind":"article","role":"article","title":"Categorizing and organizing data with content tags","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/categorizing-and-organizing-data-with-content-tags"},"doc://com.apple.foundationmodels/documentation/FoundationModels/improving-the-safety-of-generative-model-output":{"abstract":[{"text":"Create generative experiences that appropriately handle sensitive inputs and respect people.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/documentation\/FoundationModels\/improving-the-safety-of-generative-model-output","images":[{"identifier":"improving-safety-of-model-output-PageImage-card.png","type":"card"}],"kind":"article","role":"article","title":"Improving the safety of generative model output","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/foundationmodels\/improving-the-safety-of-generative-model-output"},"foundation-models-framework-landing-PageImage-card.png":{"alt":"An illustration that represents a foundation model.","identifier":"foundation-models-framework-landing-PageImage-card.png","type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["2x","light"],"url":"\/images\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/foundation-models-framework-landing-PageImage-card@2x.png"},{"traits":["2x","dark"],"url":"\/images\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/foundation-models-framework-landing-PageImage-card~dark@2x.png"}]},"https://support.apple.com/en-us/121115":{"identifier":"https:\/\/support.apple.com\/en-us\/121115","title":"How to get Apple Intelligence","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"How to get Apple Intelligence","type":"text"}],"type":"link","url":"https:\/\/support.apple.com\/en-us\/121115"},"improving-safety-of-model-output-PageImage-card.png":{"alt":"An abstract illustration that represents model output encountering safety mechanisms.","identifier":"improving-safety-of-model-output-PageImage-card.png","type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["2x","light"],"url":"\/images\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/improving-safety-of-model-output-PageImage-card@2x.png"},{"traits":["2x","dark"],"url":"\/images\/com.apple.foundationmodels\/improving-safety-of-model-output-PageImage-card~dark@2x.png"}]}}}